{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object, check properties and complete task. Scan area otherwise.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = CompleteTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
